WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:04.070
Welcome to the College of Fine Arts,
which has five schools within it:

2
00:00:04.070 --> 00:00:07.440
Art, Architecture, Music,
Drama and Design.

3
00:00:07.507 --> 00:00:10.443
Around us we see various sculptures
which are on permanent loan

4
00:00:10.443 --> 00:00:14.247
to us from the Metropolitan
Museum of Art in New York City.

5
00:00:14.247 --> 00:00:15.849
Within the School of Design, 

6
00:00:15.849 --> 00:00:19.853
students are trained in real world challenges
and hands on experiences in the studio.

7
00:00:19.853 --> 00:00:23.089
Drama is one of the top programs
in the country which students prepare

8
00:00:23.089 --> 00:00:26.359
for a variety of roles,
from backstage to on stage.

9
00:00:26.493 --> 00:00:28.561
Music offers conservatory style training,

10
00:00:28.561 --> 00:00:31.398
where students practice
in small groups with professors

11
00:00:31.398 --> 00:00:32.132
and receive individual training.

12
00:00:32.132 --> 00:00:32.899
with professors and receive individual
training and architecture,

13
00:00:32.899 --> 00:00:35.568
And Architecture has a four and five year program, 

14
00:00:35.568 --> 00:00:36.903
with a five year program

15
00:00:36.903 --> 00:00:40.740
enabling students to become fully licensed
architects upon graduation.

16
00:00:40.874 --> 00:00:44.878
All the programs here have an emphasis
on applicability to real world problems.

17
00:00:44.911 --> 00:00:49.349
The curriculum is designed with social
impact, technology and creativity in mind,

18
00:00:49.382 --> 00:00:53.486
so graduates are equipped to deal
with realistic situations upon graduation.

19
00:00:53.520 --> 00:00:56.723
There's also a BxA Degree program
which offers students

20
00:00:56.723 --> 00:00:59.459
the opportunity to major in a fine
arts discipline

21
00:00:59.459 --> 00:01:02.162
combined with any other discipline
from another college,

22
00:01:02.162 --> 00:01:04.097
with the exception of Business.

23
00:01:04.097 --> 00:01:06.032
Students are officially a part of both colleges,

24
00:01:06.032 --> 00:01:09.236
and a popular major is called BCSA,

25
00:01:09.236 --> 00:01:11.604
which stands for the Bachelors
in Computer Science and Art.

26
00:01:11.604 --> 00:01:15.275
And actually there is a course here
at CMU called Art in Machine Learning,

27
00:01:15.275 --> 00:01:18.912
and it was developed jointly by an Art
and Machine Learning professor.

28
00:01:18.945 --> 00:01:22.715
And it really emphasizes
the interdisciplinary focus at the University.

29
00:01:23.016 --> 00:01:25.585
Apart from the major,
pursuing a minor is also available.

30
00:01:25.618 --> 00:01:28.755
And there are many ways to engage,
even if you are not ready to commit

31
00:01:28.755 --> 00:01:33.726
to a minor, like clubs like Scotch and Soda
and the Inter University Orchestra.

